that did just that. It's actually called a barrier layer that would keep the

445
00:34:06,001 --> 00:34:11,760
copper sort of on top of the devices and so it wouldn't be able to go down to the

446
00:34:11,761 --> 00:34:18,360
to the actual device layers. This advance made it possible to fabricate smaller

447
