the old days to coat the bottom of a cooking pot with copper, but with

451
00:34:42,761 --> 00:34:48,040
certain chemicals that allow the electroplating process to just perfectly

452
00:34:48,041 --> 00:34:53,853
fill all of these trenches with copper metal, and those are our interconnects.

453
00:34:53,854 --> 00:34:55,120
It's a thousandth

454
00:34:55,121 --> 00:35:02,080
the size of a human hair. Chip assembly takes place in what's called a clean room.

455
00:35:02,780 --> 00:35:07,500
We can't tolerate any speck of dust because that's larger than the interconnects we want

456
00:35:07,501 --> 00:35:08,201
to make.

